ifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":["Tests cover the three staged samples and two header-name capitalization forms rather than every possible RFC822 formatting variation; the captured implementation provides additional direct support for general case-insensitive header-name handling.","There is no separate long-running mail service or cluster in this task; restart recovery was therefore demonstrated through entry-point execution, retained files, delivery data, platform state, and clean global health observations."]}
